# The sprite bundles embed their atlas as a single ~1.6 MB base64 data-URI line. A textual merge
# of that line cannot produce valid base64, and no human can resolve the conflict by hand, so
# -merge makes a conflict fail loudly instead: regenerate the bundle, which is the only correct
# resolution. -diff keeps the whole-file rewrite of every regeneration out of the diff.
tools/DataEditor/sprites-*.html linguist-generated=true -diff -merge
tools/DataEditor/schema.js linguist-generated=true
